           "I have been studying the ruins for many\n"
           "years, but something feels...\f"
           "different.\r")
    closemessage
    applymovement(obj_D24R0216_suit, RuinsOfAlph_UndergroundHall_SinjohEvent_Movement_BusinessmanWalkUpLeft)
